1Z8GOxEnZ3Tr0YYw.jpg"},{"id":125584,"name":"Tiina Lymi","role":"Spa manager","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7YZqiKNjJsrAhYjthTZIKC101K2.jpg"},{"id":3204425,"name":"Unto Ikkala","role":"Assistant Director of the Spa"},{"id":2121704,"name":"Dimitri Okulov","role":"Assistant adr"},{"id":233946,"name":"Satu Paavola","role":"Cotton-looking Anneli"},{"id":2175425,"name":"Petteri Pennilä","role":"Factory manager","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sNFSCaGcs6txMHyK5RlV76W47ti.jpg"},{"id":1710165,"name":"Tatu Siivonen","role":"Maintenance man"},{"id":3204428,"name":"Jarkko Nieminen","role":"Tennis player"},{"id":2008803,"name":"Marko Talli","role":"Tennis player"},{"id":1637770,"name":"Keijo Leppänen","role":"Newsreader"},{"id":2966515,"name":"Pekka Kauhanen","role":"Police in the news broadcast"},{"id":3204430,"name":"Minea Bröckl","role":"The girl in the news broadcast"},{"id":3204432,"name":"Lilian Ranta","role":"The girl in the news broadcast"},{"id":2301592,"name":"Minna Virkajärvi","role":"Guinea pig center"},{"id":2725926,"name":"Kaius Österman","role":"Baseball Player (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Super Palla di Pelo","overview":"Emilia è la tipica figlia di divorziati. Va a scuola, vive con la madre e a volte con suo padre, e la sua vita non potrebbe essere più normale. Ma, un giorno, il suo porcellino d’India le morde il dito. Emilia acquisisce così la segreta abilità di trasformarsi in una supereroina pelosa in grado di volare e di risolvere ogni problema con i suoi superpoteri. Contemporaneamente, le aringhe della vicina baia del mar Baltico invocano aiuto. L’acqua del mare avvelenata le ha rese furiose, minacciando la pace e la tranquillità dell’intera città. Emilia, da supereroina qual è, si assume la responsabilità di risolvere la situazione e di diventare una persona più coraggiosa."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Super Furball","overview":"Emilia is a suburban kid. She goes to school, lives with her Mom and sometimes her Dad, and her life couldn’t be more ordinary. But one day Emilia’s pet hamster bites her finger. Emilia gets a secret superpower to transform into Super Furball, who can fly and solve problems with her superpowers. At the same time, the herrings in the nearby Baltic Sea bay are screaming for help because of poisoned water. As the Super Furball, Emilia takes it upon herself to fix the situation and finds ways to be more courageous in her own life."},{"language":"fi-FI","overview":"Emilia on uusioperheen lapsi Itä-Helsingistä. Hän käy koulua, asuu äitinsä ja välillä isänsäkin luona, ja elämä on tavallistakin tavallisempaa. Sitten eräänä päivänä Emilian lemmikkimarsu puraisee häntä. Emilia saa salaisen kyvyn muuntautua Supermarsuksi, joka osaa lentää ja ratkoa ongelmia supervoimillaan. Samaan aikaan läheisessä merenpoukamassa asuvat Itämeren silakat huutavat apua. Saastunut vesi on tehnyt ne raivoisiksi, ja ne uhkaavat pian koko Itä-Helsingin rauhaa. Emilia lähtee Supermarsuna pelastamaan tilannetta. Mutta onko tehtävä liian vaikea jopa Supermarsulle?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bwE8YGPXC1nU9Z1rn1JsXc4pdJw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bwE8YGPXC1nU9Z1rn1JsXc4pdJw.jpg","language":"it","width":1175,"height":1763},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eQnA0nTB8BPD9EDXbMtocAnC5kf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eQnA0nTB8BPD9EDXbMtocAnC5kf.jpg","language":"en","width":644,"height":967},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aGwbpl8RCDQdN8tX863p6lnDgfT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aGwbpl8RCDQdN8tX863p6lnDgfT.jpg","language":"fi","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8pOsqaGzKoqnaPSDhATS42pFc1H.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8pOsqaGzKoqnaPSDhATS42pFc1H.jpg","